## Common List-Page Pattern

Most data pages reuse the same combination. When building a new list page, use all of these together:

- `Table` or `Design2Table` — data display
- `SearchForm` — search input
- `DateSelect` — date range filter
- `DropdownFilter` — column/field filter
- `DropdownDynamic` — multi-select filter
- `PaginationClassic` — pagination
- `FeedbackModal` — confirm/delete dialogs
- `SearchableListModal` — item selection dialogs
- `Alert` — success/error feedback
- `usePagination` — cursor-based pagination hook

